OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the people who turned a hobby
OL,4,Ainto a job
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is an old saying: "Find a job you
OL,7,Flove and you will never have to work a
OL,8,Fday in your life."
OL,10,FThat for many people might prompt a
OL,11,Fsnort of derision. But what if you
OL,12,Fcould turn your favourite hobby into
OL,13,Fsomething that actually turned a
OL,14,Fprofit.
OL,16,FThe disruption caused by the Covid-19
OL,17,Fpandemic and the opportunities of
OL,18,Fonline retailing have opened up an
OL,19,Fentire world of serious side-hustles
OL,20,Fand enterprises on internet
OL,21,Fmarketplaces.
